 "details": "Three-day rock festival with about 90,000 visitors; campsites open 2 June. 50 acts confirmed by Oct 2026; about 10,000 tickets left (dpa, 21 Oct 2026). Headliners: blink-182, Die Toten Hosen, Bring Me The Horizon. Friday 4 June: blink-182, Falling in Reverse, Billy Talent, Pendulum, Killswitch Engage, The Prodigy (very special guest). Saturday: Die Toten Hosen, Turnstile, Faith No More, Bad Religion, Bullet For My Valentine, Nothing But Thieves. Sunday 6 June: Bring Me The Horizon, Parkway Drive, Evanescence, Amon Amarth, Arch Enemy, Lorna Shore, Motionless In White, Jinjer.",
